# Grand View Research

> Grand View Research (GVR) is a U.S.-based market research and consulting firm publishing 15,900+ syndicated market research reports across 45+ industries, alongside subscription intelligence platforms (Horizon), commodity pricing data (Signal), procurement intelligence (Pipeline), ESG ratings (Astra), and custom consulting services (Brainshare). Reports cover market size, share, growth forecasts (typically through 2033), segmentation, competitive landscape, and regional analysis.

Headquartered in San Francisco, GVR has served 10,000+ clients across 44 countries, including most Fortune 500 companies, and publishes 240+ new syndicated reports per year.

